<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 28.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 28.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 28	     April 25</p>
<p>Fed acct			40.327		 23.881</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  37.279		 37.258</p>
<p>Cash balance		  77.607		 61.139</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,261.300	     5,259.242</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $90 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
